    "body": "## DUNCAN PRIME / WORKSTREAM B — CHAT HANDOFF CHECKPOINT\n\n**IDENTITY**\n`DUNCAN PRIME / WORKSTREAM B — WORLD / CAMERA / S001 CONTRACT PREP`\n\n**OWNER COMMUNICATION LAW (for this workstream and handoff chats)**\nEvery response must visibly identify who is speaking. Use a clear role signature such as:\n`DUNCAN PRIME / WORKSTREAM B`\nDo not leave role identity implicit.\n\n**RESULT**\n- #250 fresh-read and accepted as PREP-only downstream workstream.\n- Current `main` HEAD fresh-read: `b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`.\n- Current studio branch fresh-read: `duncan/zorr-studio-r01` HEAD `66a377f47f30aa19a64a1f2f7ed8c7d246670547`.\n- Constitution + AGENTS + orchestration contract fresh-read.\n- Existing studio laws inspected for world/camera/S001 prep.\n\n**EVIDENCE / FINDINGS**\n- `studio/ZORR_STUDIO_R01.md`: 9:16 is S001-specific assumption only; S001 must resolve aspect ratio, output resolution, FPS, framing, overscan and camera push envelope before physical shot assets.\n- `studio/ZORR_OWNER_REFERENCE_ATLAS_INTEGRATION_R01.md`: provisional world direction = `SEVERE LUXURY + GRAPHIC ARCHITECTURE + CONTROLLED UNEASE`; treat as OWNER-taste evidence, not production canon.\n- `studio/CHARACTER_LAYER_SPLIT_R01.md`: minimum later physical scene hierarchy must preserve CHAR identity/ground anchors and separately managed scene depth layers.\n- `studio/CHARACTER_LIFE_SMOKE_TIMING_R01.md`: camera/parallax proof must be rendered/measured; no curve-only PASS.\n- Workstream A fresh evidence: #248 has `MECHANICS_DEFINITION = LOCKED_CANDIDATE`, but `VISUAL_REPEATABILITY_WITNESS = OPEN`; six costume visual witnesses are still missing, so `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 != PASS`. `POSE_MECHANICS_VISUAL_R01` remains downstream and is not open yet.\n\n**OPEN**\n- No `CAMERA_LAYOUT_VISUAL_R01` durable contract file exists yet on the studio branch.\n- S001 format values (aspect/output/FPS/framing/overscan/max push) are not yet proven/locked.\n- Physical BG/MID/FG/CHAR source contract is not yet durably specified.\n- Downstream PASS is CLOSED until upstream gate sequence legally opens it.\n\n**NEXT**\nContinue PREP-only work from this checkpoint:\n1. draft `CAMERA_LAYOUT_VISUAL_R01` requirements and numeric camera-envelope fields without inventing unresolved values;\n2. draft S001 shot-contract matrix with `RESOLVED / ASSUMPTION / NOT_PROVEN` classification;\n3. define exact BG/MID/FG/CHAR physical source requirements and measurable parallax/occlusion checks;\n4. persist to GitHub as spec/checkpoint only;\n5. do **not** claim CAMERA/WORLD/S001 PASS and do **not** build physical S001 assets before real upstream authorization.\n\n**HANDOFF BOOTSTRAP FOR NEW CHAT**\n`ZORR MODE. Ты DUNCAN PRIME / WORKSTREAM B. Продолжай issue #250 от последнего durable checkpoint в #250. Всегда явно подписывай, кто ты. Не открывай downstream PASS раньше законного gate. ПРОД.`",
