    "body": "Parallel chat workstream B under DUNCAN PRIME orchestration.\n\nCURRENT AUTHORITY:\n- #245 FULL_CHARACTER_MODEL_LOCK_R02 = PASS\n- #248 COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 remains the active production gate in workstream A\n- branch authority: duncan/zorr-studio-r01\n\nROLE:\nPrepare downstream world/camera/shot integration without competing with the active character-mechanics gate.\n\nPREP ORDER:\n1. CAMERA_LAYOUT_VISUAL_R01 requirements and camera-envelope questions\n2. ZORR world integration using existing severe-luxury / graphic-architecture / controlled-unease laws\n3. S001 contract audit: aspect ratio, output resolution, FPS, framing, overscan, max camera move/push\n4. identify exact physical BG/MID/FG/CHAR source requirements for later S001 build\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- 9:16 remains S001-specific assumption only; not global canon.\n- do not build S001 physical assets before upstream character/costume/pose gates permit it.\n- do not redesign character identity or costume.\n- do not reopen Babylon as scene master; optional spatial evidence only if a real geometry blocker exists.\n- no image generation/editing without exact OWNER authorization.\n\nOUTPUT CONTRACT:\nPersist findings to GitHub as RESULT / EVIDENCE / OPEN / NEXT. This workstream may resolve specs and blockers but must not claim downstream production PASS before prerequisite gates close.\n\nHANDOFF TO MASTER CHAT:\nReturn exact shot/world/camera decisions, unresolved format questions, blockers, and files/issues touched.",
